cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Demographic-Spatial Modeling of Slavic Linguistic Expansion in the
  Balkans, c. 600-860 CE: Replication Package for the JLG Submission
message: >-
  If you use this software, data, or its outputs, please cite both
  the accompanying journal paper and this archived replication package.
authors:
